// @emit-error only i32[] arrays and struct/union element arrays are supported
// THE WITNESS FOR A GATE THAT WAS BRIEFLY OPENED BY THE WRONG PREDICATE.
// `structIdxOfElemName`'s trailing gate asks `nameIsStructDecl(sNames[si])` — is the row
// a declared STRUCT — and its header records why it must stay a loud REJECT: admitting a
// shape-armed union routes it into the union-arm narrow machinery, whose read side still
// mis-lowers that flow.
//
